.TH GITIA 1 "{{.Date}}" "gitia {{.Version}}" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
gitia \- generate Conventional Commits from the staged diff with a local model
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gitia
.RI [ command ]
.RI [ flags ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B gitia
generates a Conventional Commits message from the staged diff using a model
running locally under Ollama. Nothing leaves the machine.
.PP
It respects the conventions a repository already declares \(em
.IR AGENTS.md ,
.IR CLAUDE.md ,
.I GEMINI.md
and commitlint \(em rather than imposing its own. When a commitlint
configuration is present, gitia conforms to it: commitlint is a hard validity
gate applied across every other layer of preference, and gitia prints a warning
naming the rule that overrode a preference.
.PP
.B gitia
reads only the staging area. It never stages files on your behalf, so it cannot
commit work you were not ready to ship.
{{.Commands}}
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B GITIA_CONFIG_DIR
Overrides the configuration directory. Takes precedence over
.BR XDG_CONFIG_HOME .
.TP
.B XDG_CONFIG_HOME
When set, the configuration directory is
.IR $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/gitia .
Used on macOS as well as Linux.
.TP
.B OLLAMA_HOST
Base URL of the Ollama server. Takes precedence over
.I ollama.host
in the configuration file.
.TP
.B EDITOR ", " VISUAL
The editor opened by the
.B [e]
choice at the confirmation prompt.
.BR EDITOR " is tried first, then " VISUAL ", then " vi .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/gitia/config.toml
User configuration. A missing file is not an error; every value has a default.
.TP
.I ~/.config/gitia/commitlint/
Cached
.B commitlint --print-config json
output, keyed on the configuration and lockfile modification times.
.TP
.IR ./AGENTS.md ", " ./CLAUDE.md ", " ./GEMINI.md
Repository conventions. Sections whose headings mention
.IR commit ", " git ", " changelog ", " message ", or " versioning
are included in the prompt.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
Generic error.
.TP
.B 2
Usage error.
.TP
.B 3
Not a git repository.
.TP
.B 4
Nothing staged.
.TP
.B 5
Ollama unreachable.
.TP
.B 6
Model missing and cannot be pulled non-interactively.
.TP
.B 7
Generation failed after retry.
.TP
.B 8
commitlint rejected the message.
.TP
.B 130
Aborted by the user.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR git-commit (1),
.BR ollama (1)
.PP
Conventional Commits v1.0.0: https://www.conventionalcommits.org/en/v1.0.0/
.PP
AGENTS.md: https://agents.md/
